      "dot": "cyan",
      "items": [
        "Bridge ticks sim + policy on the 5-min control hook; sim advances 1 min per step",
        "Hardware-style thermostat cutout 23.5/24.5 C gates delivered cooling + metered power",
        "Telemetry QoS 0, commands QoS 1 never-retained, retained status + LWT per node",
        "Subscriptions renew inside on_connect, so every reconnect resubscribes"
      ],
      "title": "Sense-decide-actuate loop"
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "items": [
        "100-run matrix: 5 controllers x 4 scenarios x 5 paired seeds, mean +- std",
        "Forecast arm (C4-with vs C4-as-C3) + carbon arm (hourly vs flat EF)",
        "Honest findings: comfort-per-kWh thesis, shifting ~zero, weekend tie",
        "Heatwave re-checked on 10 seeds: energy and comfort both significant"
      ],
      "title": "Evaluation rigor"
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "items": [
        "Hourly emission-factor + ToU tariff series (CEA 0.710 anchor, modelled shape)",
        "Telemetry CSVs are the experiment record; matrices crash-resume from them",
        "Frozen HistGB forecaster trains once on C1 telemetry, reused everywhere",
        "results/ is gitignored except force-added figure PNGs"
      ],
      "title": "Data and stores"
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "items": [
        "Lab broker is anonymous with TLS commented (Unit-3 note); dashboard never binds 0.0.0.0",
        "Validation is synthetic timetables + UCI demand-only (no occupancy ground truth)",
        "Out of scope by decision: MPC/RL, hardware, per-user comfort learning",
        "Wokwi ESP32 run is manual demo; CI uses the Python shim + contract test"
      ],
      "title": "Trust and limits"
    }
